{"id":"5f2dbbab-e96c-494f-b136-7a6233f01e5b","type":"level","createdDate":"2026-06-15T15:05:32.08Z","createdBy":"Sara.Smolevitz@codeninjas.com","lastModifiedDate":"2026-06-15T15:05:32.08Z","lastModifiedBy":"Sara.Smolevitz@codeninjas.com","attributes":{"tags":["CREATE"],"title":"Level 10","sequence":10,"activity":{"id":"294e90c6-8686-4b7c-945e-c461b6b7d424","type":"activity","sequence":2,"group":{"id":"899f7ac2-31ea-4359-aac7-8d13324cb31f","type":"solve","name":null,"sequence":7,"subgroups":[{"id":"c55cd2ce-e9ab-4ccf-8b06-f0410c3f21ba","type":"subgroup","sequence":1,"name":"solve 1","steps":[{"id":"6753f00e-4417-4bb1-9328-299191bf653f","hints":"<p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">❓ Did you use the documentation for help with updating the Minimap’s image and position on screen?</span></p>","senseiHelp":"<p><strong>Ask the ninja:</strong>&nbsp;</p><p>❓ What image should be passed to the <strong class=\"ql-font-monospace\">getImage</strong> function to update the mapSprite’s image?</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Solution:</strong></p><p>The default parameter in the <strong class=\"ql-font-monospace\">getImage</strong> function should be deleted and replaced with <strong class=\"ql-font-monospace\">myMinimap</strong> to set the mapSprite’s image to the existing minimap image.</p><p><img src=\"https://assets.codeninjas.com/clm/assets/images/xxadhrpt.g34.png\"></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ask the ninja:</strong>&nbsp;</p><p>❓ What should the minimap’s scale be set to so that it takes up less than half of the screen?</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Solution:</strong></p><p>The minimap’s scale should be changed in both <strong class=\"ql-font-monospace\">minimap.minimap</strong> functions. <strong class=\"ql-font-monospace\">.Half</strong> should be deleted, then a dot operator should be typed and a lesser value (Quarter, Eighth, or Sixteenth) should be selected from the code completion tool.</p><p><img src=\"https://assets.codeninjas.com/clm/assets/images/2dz3ska0.5ob.png\"></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ask the ninja:</strong>&nbsp;</p><p>❓ What sprite flag will create an element on screen that doesn’t move when the camera does?</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Solution:</strong></p><p><strong class=\"ql-font-monospace\">mapSprite.setFlag(SpriteFlag.RelativeToCamera, true)</strong> should be added under <strong class=\"ql-font-monospace\">// mini map set up</strong>.</p><p><img src=\"https://assets.codeninjas.com/clm/assets/images/naerpk2z.rco.png\"></p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ask the ninja:</strong>&nbsp;</p><p>❓ What function draws a sprite on the minimap’s image?</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Solution:</strong></p><p><strong class=\"ql-font-monospace\">minimap.includeSprite(myMinimap, treasureSprite, 0.5) </strong>should be added before the <strong class=\"ql-font-monospace\">setImage</strong> function, inside the <strong class=\"ql-font-monospace\">onUpdate</strong> loop.</p><p><img src=\"https://assets.codeninjas.com/clm/assets/images/wrivuztf.tbg.png\"></p>","instructions":"<p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Fix the bugs in the code to create a working project!</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">When the project is run, the mapSprite’s image should be set to the existing minimap.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">The minimap should take up less than half of the screen and should appear in the top left corner, regardless of the Player sprite’s position on the tilemap.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">The minimap should show the Player, Enemy, and Food sprites’ current locations and movement throughout game play.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">Use the functions in the code menu and the code completion tool to create a working version of this project!</span></p>","text":null,"type":null,"image":null,"videoUrl":null,"mediaType":null,"questions":null,"badges":null,"reflectionQuestions":null}],"title":"Debugging Minimaps","project":{"editor":{"filters":[{"name":"controller","active":false,"blocks":[{"name":"game_control_sprite","active":true},{"name":"keyonevent","active":true},{"name":"keyispressed","active":true}]},{"name":"loops","active":false,"blocks":[{"name":"forever","active":true},{"name":"device_pause","active":true},{"name":"device_while","active":true},{"name":"pxt_controls_for","active":true},{"name":"pxt_controls_for_of","active":true},{"name":"pxt-on-start","active":true}]},{"name":"Math","active":false,"blocks":[{"name":"math_js_round","active":true},{"name":"device_random","active":true},{"name":"percentchance","active":true}]},{"name":"images","active":false,"blocks":[{"name":"Image_getPixel","active":true},{"name":"Image_setPixel","active":true},{"name":"Image_replace","active":true},{"name":"Image_equals","active":true}]},{"name":"arrays","active":false,"blocks":[{"name":"lists_create_with","active":true},{"name":"lists_length","active":true},{"name":"lists_index_get","active":true},{"name":"array_removeat","active":true},{"name":"array_pop","active":true},{"name":"array_shift","active":true},{"name":"array_push","active":true},{"name":"array_indexof","active":true}]},{"name":"text","active":false,"blocks":[{"name":"text_join","active":true}]},{"name":"console","active":false,"blocks":[]},{"name":"light","active":false,"blocks":[]},{"name":"encoders","active":false,"blocks":[]}],"searchBar":true},"source":{"text":{"main.ts":"// project iniitialization\ntiles.setCurrentTilemap(tilemap`level`)\n\n// sprite set up\nlet player = sprites.create(assets.image`playerImage`, SpriteKind.Player)\ntiles.placeOnRandomTile(player, assets.tile`pathTile`)\ncontroller.moveSprite(player)\nscene.cameraFollowSprite(player)\nplayer.z = 5\n\nlet enemy = sprites.create(assets.image`enemyImage`, SpriteKind.Enemy)\ntiles.placeOnRandomTile(enemy, assets.tile`pathTile`)\nenemy.follow(player, randint(30, 80))\n\nlet treasureSprite = sprites.create(assets.image`treasureImage`, SpriteKind.Food)\ntiles.placeOnRandomTile(treasureSprite, assets.tile`pathTile`)\n\n// mini map set up\nlet myMinimap = minimap.minimap(MinimapScale., 1, 9)\nlet mapSprite = sprites.create(myMinimap.image, SpriteKind.Player)\nmapSprite.setPosition(32, 32)\nminimap.includeSprite(myMinimap, player, 0.5)\n\ngame.onUpdate(function () {\n    myMinimap = minimap.minimap(MinimapScale.Half, 1, 9)\n    minimap.includeSprite(myMinimap, player, 0.5)\n    minimap.includeSprite(myMinimap, enemy, 0.5)\n    mapSprite.setImage(minimap.getImage(let myMinimap2 = minimap.minimap()))\n})\n","pxt.json":"{\n    \"name\": \"Untitled\",\n    \"description\": \"\",\n    \"dependencies\": {\n        \"device\": \"*\",\n        \"arcade-minimap\": \"github:microsoft/arcade-minimap#v0.6.1\"\n    },\n    \"files\": [\n        \"main.ts\",\n        \"README.md\",\n        \"assets.json\",\n        \"tilemap.g.jres\",\n        \"tilemap.g.ts\",\n        \"images.g.jres\",\n        \"images.g.ts\"\n    ],\n    \"preferredEditor\": \"tsprj\",\n    \"languageRestriction\": \"javascript-only\"\n}\n","readmE.md":null,"assets.json":"","main.blocks":"<xml xmlns=\"https://developers.google.com/blockly/xml\"></xml>",".simstate.json":"{}","images.g.jres":"{\n    \"image1\": {\n        \"data\": \"hwQQABAAAAAAAAUAAAAAAAAA9QAA/w8AAFD/APDM+wAA9f/yz/z/8FD//8L7zI//9f8v8hvC/PhV3y/yuyH8+P8fLfK7IUn4VR8v8r8hSf/1/y/yvyHs/1D1//K/wuz+AFD/8vvM7/8AAPXyz/z/DwAAtQDw/PsAAAAAAAD/DwAAAAAAAAAAAA==\",\n        \"mimeType\": \"image/x-mkcd-f4\",\n        \"displayName\": \"playerImage\"\n    },\n    \"image2\": {\n        \"data\": \"\",\n        \"mimeType\": \"image/x-mkcd-f4\",\n        \"displayName\": \"enemyImage\"\n    },\n    \"image3\": {\n        \"data\": \"hwQQAA0AAAAAREREz08EAEDMT8zPzwwAPPz0zM/PBADsU1REz08EAOzFX1XsXAUA7PVG5ezsBQDs9VXu7OwOAOz1X+7s7A4A7PVP5ezsDgDs9VVf7OwOAOz1We